"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"If you found this work interesting, you might be interested in the following material:\n"
"- [Sample-based Krylov quantum diagonalization of a fermionic lattice model](/tutorials/sample-based-krylov-quantum-diagonalization) - a related tutorial using time evolution circuits instead of a variational ansatz\n"
"- [Scale SQD chemistry workflows with Dice solver](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/integrate-dice-solver) - a page showing how to use the more efficient Dice software for diagonalization\n"
"- [SQD addon API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion#diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian) - reference for the `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian` function\n"
"- [*Chemistry beyond the scale of exact diagonalization on a quantum-centric supercomputer*](https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.adu9991) - the paper this tutorial is based on\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"คำแนะนำ\">\n"
"หากคุณพบว่างานนี้น่าสนใจ คุณอาจสนใจเนื้อหาต่อไปนี้:\n"
"- [Sample-based Krylov quantum diagonalization of a fermionic lattice model](/tutorials/sample-based-krylov-quantum-diagonalization) - บทแนะนำที่เกี่ยวข้องโดยใช้ time evolution Circuit แทน variational ansatz\n"
"- [Scale SQD chemistry workflows with Dice solver](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/how_tos/integrate_dice_solver.html) - หน้าที่แสดงวิธีใช้ซอฟต์แวร์ Dice ที่มีประสิทธิภาพมากขึ้นสำหรับการ diagonalization\n"
"- [SQD addon API documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-addon-sqd/apidocs/qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.html#qiskit_addon_sqd.fermion.diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian) - reference สำหรับฟังก์ชัน `diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian`\n"
"- [*Chemistry beyond the scale of exact diagonalization on a quantum-centric supercomputer*](https://www.science.org/doi/10.1126/sciadv.adu9991) - บทความที่ tutorial นี้อ้างอิงถึง\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

